# What the image build is allowed to see.
#
# An allowlist rather than a list of exclusions, because the cost of getting
# it wrong runs one way: anything that reaches the context lands in the
# builder's `COPY . .` layer, so editing a manual page or a CI script would
# invalidate the cached build of a workspace that does not depend on it — and
# `target/` alone is gigabytes.
#
# Everything the build needs is the workspace and the pins around it.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!clippy.toml
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates
crates/**/target
